0ahUKEwj_noHnxdKWAxXWa_UHHXgzCuYQ3YcHCHooAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwj_noHnxdKWAxXWa_UHHXgzCuYQ3IcHCHkoCA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["三種口味都收集到了！\n每種口味都各有千秋 不分軒輊\n推薦大家都吃吃看😋\n\n老闆娘人超好 很像溫柔的媽媽～\n我怕太辣還先讓我試喝辣味湯頭😍\n大概只有微辣\n不夠辣可以再加\n\n單純豚骨湯頭也很濃醇香\n我每次都會把湯喝光光！\n\n上次吃柚香雞白湯很讚 清爽好吃😋\n雞湯香醇口齒留香\n還有撒上柚子胡椒畫龍點睛\n每碗都附整顆溏心蛋 超佛！\n叉燒有炙燒過 很大一片 每碗2片\n評論再送一片 也可換溏心蛋\n麵只有細麵\n上餐速度超快\n\n現在竟然有烏龍麵了\n下次要吃吃看！\n\n上次肚子突然超痛\n感謝老闆娘願意外借廁所拯救急需🥺\n\n現在母親節每碗特價$110\n只到5/31 趕快來吃！\n祝老闆娘母親節快樂❤️\n\n就在公司對面而已\n會常常來吃！",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17265755304532092354/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRVTNodE5YWlNNemRQZVRCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17265755304532092354/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRVTNodE5YWlNNemRQZVRCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17265755304532092354/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRVTNodE5YWlNNemRQZVRCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17265755304532092354/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRVTNodE5YWlNNemRQZVRCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17265755304532092354/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRVTNodE5YWlNNemRQZVRCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17265755304532092354/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZRVTNodE5YWlNNemRQZVRCblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,4934,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQU3htNXZSMzdPeTBnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf66c146bce3ed8dc!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEPSxm5vR37Oy0gE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQU3htNXZSMzdPeTBnRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQU3htNXZSMzdPeTBnRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VQRFlxTnpjeWNEOVl3EhJDZ3NJanZYV3dRWVFzTUdCU2caLQoXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTVBZa2VhWDVQNmx3QUUSEkNnc0